>> Animal := Nkan tuntun.
>> Factory := Nkan tuntun.

Animal nigbati: ['tuntun'] ṣe: {
	>> animal := ara-rẹ tuntun.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal nigbati: ['sound:'] ṣe: { :s
	tirẹ sound := s.
}.

Animal nigbati: ['sound'] ṣe: { <- tirẹ sound.
}.

>> Dog := Nkan tuntun.
>> Cat := Nkan tuntun.

Dog nigbati: ['tuntun'] ṣe: { <- Animal tuntun sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat nigbati: ['tuntun'] ṣe: { <- Animal tuntun sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Ijade kọ: Dog tuntun sound, ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: Cat tuntun sound, ila-tuntun.

Factory nigbati: ['mix:and:'] ṣe: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal tuntun sound: (
		( beast1 sound lati: 0 gigun: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound lati: 2 gigun: 5 )
	).
}.

Ijade kọ: (Factory mix: Dog tuntun and: Cat tuntun) sound, ila-tuntun.
